NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000112 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000113 "=head1 SUPPORT"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000114 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000115 "Bugs may be submitted at L<https://github.com/houseabsolute/List-SomeUtils-XS/issues>."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000116 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000117 "I am also usually active on IRC as 'autarch' on C<irc://irc.perl.org>."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000118 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000119 "=head1 SOURCE"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000120 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000121 "The source code repository for List-SomeUtils-XS can be found at L<https://github.com/houseabsolute/List-SomeUtils-XS>."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000122 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000123 "=head1 DONATIONS"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000124 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000125 "If you'd like to thank me for the work I've done on this module, please"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000126 "consider making a \"donation\" to me via PayPal. I spend a lot of free time"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000127 "creating free software, and would appreciate any support you'd care to offer."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000128 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000129 "Please note that B<I am not suggesting that you must do this> in order for me"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000130 "to continue working on this particular software. I will continue to do so,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000131 "inasmuch as I have in the past, for as long as it interests me."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000132 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000133 "Similarly, a donation made in this way will probably not make me work on this"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000134 "software much more, unless I get so many donations that I can consider working"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000135 "on free software full time (let's all have a chuckle at that together)."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000136 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000137 "To donate, log into PayPal and send money to autarch@urth.org, or use the"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000138 "button at L<http://www.urth.org/~autarch/fs-donation.html>."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000139 ""
